From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 16:01:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 011/117] dt-bindings: spi: add T8010 SPI support

The SPI controller in T8010 predates the implementations used by newer
Apple SoCs.  It has legacy status and descriptor formats, a minimum clock
divider of two and can feed transmit data through SmartIO.

Add the T8010 compatible and an optional legacy word-delay property.  Model
exactly one DMA channel named "tx": this series implements only the SPI3
transmit endpoint and neither the controller nor SIO supports receive DMA.

Keep the existing compatibles and non-T8010 properties unchanged.  Add a
T8010 SPI MAINTAINERS section for the binding; the controller path follows
in the next commit.

The schema passes dt-doc-validate, and the final J172 DT was validated
against it before the complete series passed the DT620 hardware test.

Signed-off-by: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>

Orchard-replay-of: 079c27971b3ce6d24734da9e075bb9834296a763
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml      | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 MAINTAINERS                                     |  7 +++++++
 2 files changed, 24 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
index 9356b9c33..ac39df7b4 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@ allOf:
 
 maintainers:
   - Hector Martin <marcan@marcan.st>
+  - Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
 
 properties:
   compatible:
@@ -20,6 +21,7 @@ properties:
           - const: apple,t8103-spi
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - apple,t8010-spi
               - apple,t8103-spi
               - apple,t8112-spi
               - apple,t6000-spi
@@ -37,12 +39,27 @@ properties:
   power-domains:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  dmas:
+    maxItems: 1
+
+  dma-names:
+    const: tx
+
+  apple,t8010-word-delay:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
+    description:
+      Legacy T8010 inter-word delay register value.
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
   - clocks
   - interrupts
 
+dependentRequired:
+  dmas:
+    - dma-names
+
 unevaluatedProperties: false
 
 examples:
diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index bd2d3896f..b0779c495 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -2716,6 +2716,13 @@ F:	include/linux/mfd/macsmc.h
 F:	include/linux/soc/apple/*
 F:	include/uapi/drm/asahi_drm.h
 
+APPLE T8010 SPI SUPPORT
